            You can add properties individually or upload multiple at once via CSV.
          </p>
          <div className="flex items-center justify-center space-x-4">
            <a
              href="/properties/add"
              className="bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors ease-out"
            >
              + Add Your First Property
            </a>
            <a
              href="/admin/import"
              className="border-2 border-brand text-brand hover:bg-brand hover:text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors ease-out"
            >
              📁 Import from ERP
            </a>
          </div>
